Camelot root filesystem

This disk was built on the host by `cargo xtask fs`, with the mkfs of the
camelot-fs crate. Its format is in docs/camelot-fs.md.

/README   this file
/bin      the user programs, the same ones the kernel embeds

The kernel mounts it at boot and lists /. Running programs from /bin and
the file system calls come next (issue #67).
